<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109558" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποχάσκω</span></b> , aor. 2
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέχᾰνον,</span>
		pf.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκέχηνα</span> (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάσκω</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gape a little,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				314
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				6.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακὸν ὑποχάσκειν</span> it is
			bad for the patient <i>to have the mouth a little open,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.46
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μικρὸν ὑποκεχηνυῖαι τὸ στόμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ach.Tat.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῦκα ὑ.</span>
			<i>open a little</i> (as they ripen), <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Im.</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
